# Python bytecode — regenerated on every run. Tracking these made `git pull` abort on the server,
# because the deploy host generates the same __pycache__/main.cpython-3xx.pyc as an untracked file
# and git refuses to overwrite it with the tracked copy.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
# Daily health report state (health_report.py) — local to each host, must not block `git pull`.
.health_report_state.json
.health_report_state.json.tmp
.health_report_state.lock
